 (text "Each board is its own KiCad project with its own PCB; this project only joins their sheets. Do not create a PCB here.\nGenerated by reveng/tools/mk_system.py from reveng/SYSTEM_MAP.txt; edit the map, not this sheet.\nSignal pins join by net labels of the same name (IN, OUT per board, e.g. N24_IN). Supplies join through the global power symbols on the boards.\nCard-local grounds (LGNDn) are tied to GND1 (measuring zero) or GND2 (supply zero) as in the ZERO CONNECTIONS inset of each card drawing." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fdd8e457-6651-58ae-a4ca-3cf6984ea0ac"))
